\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":17,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"britannica.com\",\"data\":\"He found that the volume of a sphere is two-thirds the volume of a cylinder that encloses it, a discovery he valued so highly that he requested a sphere and cylinder be placed on his tomb.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQE5-mq0hQ95SKl2sL7SAk_nqDVrAq7aS-wLLyjWUFdjiRjOOjrPtHX8ILxWDTwuwIEdA52WTAcsEXQVtgNpCXKwe4u2_R8gu5fm12X9NXPkc9wT9zzxsc5Zk4hLUhhlKZkGG9InvT8lN3o=\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1784281735,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"49d23c58-e096-443e-bcbe-4ae4e39e267e\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":18,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"britannica.com\",\"data\":\"Despite orders from the Roman general, Marcellus, that he should not be harmed, he was killed by a Roman soldier.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQE5-mq0hQ95SKl2sL7SAk_nqDVrAq7aS-wLLyjWUFdjiRjOOjrPtHX8ILxWDTwuwIEdA52WTAcsEXQVtgNpCXKwe4u2_R8gu5fm12X9NXPkc9wT9zzxsc5Zk4hLUhhlKZkGG9InvT8lN3o=\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1784281735,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"49d23c58-e096-443e-bcbe-4ae4e39e267e\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":19,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"britannica.com\",\"data\":\"One account suggests he was so engrossed in a mathematical problem that he refused to leave his work.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQE5-mq0hQ95SKl2sL7SAk_nqDVrAq7aS-wLLyjWUFdjiRjOOjrPtHX8ILxWDTwuwIEdA52WTAcsEXQVtgNpCXKwe4u2_R8gu5fm12X9NXPkc9wT9zzxsc5Zk4hLUhhlKZkGG9InvT8lN3o=\",\"reference_type\